 Submissions -->\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-secondary/40 rounded flex flex-col gap-2.5 relative\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-secondary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\">[PRIORITY 1 • DEADLINE 18:00 CEST]</span>\n<span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary\"></span>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-headline-sm text-subhead font-normal text-on-surface leading-snug\">\n              Grade 4 Capstone Submissions for WEB-101 Module 07\n            </h4>\n<p class=\"font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant\">\n              Required for external jury advancement. Automated kinematic checks already completed with 100% test coverage.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-surface-container\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-outline\">STATUS: 4 OF 14 PENDING</span>\n<button class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-secondary text-on-secondary rounded font-caption text-caption font-medium hover:bg-on-secondary-container transition-colors\">\n                Open Queue\n              </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task 2: External Juror Confirmation -->\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-container-high rounded flex flex-col gap-2.5 hover:border-outline-variant transition-colors\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-outline uppercase tracking-wider\">[JURY ROSTER CONFIRMATION]</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-on-surface-variant\">TOMORROW</span>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-headline-sm text-subhead font-normal text-on-surface leading-snug\">\n              Confirm External Juror Roster for Oral Defense\n            </h4>\n<p class=\"font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant\">\n              Invited Panel: <strong class=\"text-on-surface font-medium\">Course Instructor</strong> (ETH Zürich) and <strong class=\"text-on-surface font-medium\">Elena Kostic</strong> (Foster+Partners).\n            </p>\n<div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-surface-container\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-primary-container font-semibold\">[INVITATIONS NOTIFICATIONED]</span>\n<button class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface rounded font-caption text-caption transition-colors\">\n                Confirm Panel\n              </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Task 3: Publish G-Code Spec -->\n<div class=\"p-4 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-container-high rounded flex flex-col gap-2.5 hover:border-outline-variant transition-colors\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-outline uppercase tracking-wider\">[COURSE CONTENT RELEASE]</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-outline\">WEEK 08</span>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"font-headline-sm text-subhead font-normal text-on-surface leading-snug\">\n              Publish Module 08 'Multi-Objective Structural Optimization'\n            </h4>\n<p class=\"font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant\">\n              Requires release of sample Grasshopper scripts, Python bindings for finite element simulation, and raw timber batch specifications.\n            </p>\n<div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-surface-container\">\n<span class=\"font-label-mono-xs text-label-mono-xs text-outline\">DRAFT READY</span>\n<button class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container hover:bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface rounded font-caption text-caption transition-colors\">\n                Review &amp; Publish\n              </button>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- SECTION 04: SYNCHRONOUS DASHBOARD DEFENSES & OFFICE HOURS -->\n<section class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<di